"宋"}},{"title":"送伦化主","author":"陈师道","text":"赤髭白足可怜生，蹑蹻担囊壮此行。\n要致雪峰千五百，不妨兼识谢宣城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送姚先生归宜山三首 其三","author":"陈师道","text":"宇定心清面发丹，下床投杖觉轻安。\n此身已许壶丘子，他日争寻靖长官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送姚先生归宜山三首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"老逢熙运乞前官，病遇先生得内丹。\n一饱有期吾事了，千年不死后人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送姚先生归宜山三首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"郑公龙变不容亲，犹有先生不绝尘。\n定力不为生死动，始知天地有闲人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"项城道中寄刘令使修溪桥","author":"陈师道","text":"老怯危桥泥没膝，喜闻吾党政如春。\n须君不惜千金费，此后宁无我辈人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"席上劝客酒","author":"陈师道","text":"稍开襟抱使心宽，大放酒肠须盏乾。\n珠帘十里城南道，肯作当年小杜看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徐仙书三首 其三","author":"陈师道","text":"金华牧羊小家子，西真攘桃何代儿。\n诗著海山书落爪，向来那免世人疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徐仙书三首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"诗成已作客儿语，笔下还为鲁直书。\n岂是神仙未贤圣，不随时事向人疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徐仙书三首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"蓬壶仙子补天手，笔妙诗清万世功。\n肯学黄家元祐脚，信知人厄匪天穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斋居","author":"陈师道","text":"青奴白牯静相宜，老罢形骸不自持。\n一枕西窗深闭閤，卧听丛竹雨来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眠云斋","author":"陈师道","text":"已是登临晚，长须爱惜春。\n终当捐世事，来作卧云人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦少章见过","author":"陈师道","text":"淮南小山秦氏子，旧雨不来今雨来。\n风席起尘晨突冷，坐看鸟迹破苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读白乐天临水坐诗","author":"陈师道","text":"西方社里收身早，白发人中得计长。\n不作北门东掖客，更无闲事可思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒户献花以奉先圣戏作","author":"陈师道","text":"萧萧竹雨乱鸣鸦，袅袅风窗暗碧纱。\n玉座尘埃香火冷，酒家来献一枝花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陶朱公庙","author":"陈师道","text":"千篇奏牍漫多知，百战收功未出奇。\n名下难居身可辱，却将湖海换西施。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄北山顺法师二首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"山下游尘不污人，耳边溪水去犹闻。\n羡君身世浑无事，坐看青山过白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄北山顺法师二首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"十年闻问不逢人，一面相逢过所闻。\n高士不应轻俗士，欲将污脚上垂云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]